se  everybody knows he specializes in horror  films and that was the tone feige wanted  the sequel to have the reason this was  the right time to introduce this tone  was because the multiverse makes you  realize if there's something cool out  there there's also something dangerous  there's also something scary there's  also something hiding under your bed  number 10 it'll be hard to stay composed  with music like this composer danny  elfman believes the key to interweaving  the suspense for him was any movie like  this is a giant puzzle what made doctor  strange stand out was that just in this  particular puzzle there was some horror  for some of the horror music he used a  special extra-low brass sound that's  reminiscent of old-fashioned horror  sound he really likes number 11. she's  got the star power sochi gomez is  playing a 14 year old version of america  chavez which is younger than any of the  versions in the comics elizabeth gave  sochi great advice when she first  started out and that was never be shy  about giving any notes tips or opinions  on things chavez is an openly queer hero  and the actor and movie are the subjects  of controversy over not her sexuality  but 12 seconds of her talking about her  two moms disney refuses to cut the scene  for releases in other countries sochi  said it's a big deal that america is in  this movie it's just huge and i'm just  so happy that marvel has stuck to it and  kept the scene in there and it's just  pretty crazy that i get to be the one  who plays america  number 12 the multiverse is an actor's  playground elizabeth olsen flew to  london just two days after wrapping  wandavision to film multiverse of  madness i just keep coming back and i'm  always surprised every time wanda has a  newfound confidence olson is always  referring back to other films but keeps  adding new elements she thinks audiences  will enjoy but we basically all just  look like fools while we're filming  benedict cumberbatch loves playing  different versions of doctor strange  saying so to play different versions of  him really tick that box rachel mcadams  hasn't been around for the many many  movies the others have i had to go back  to my notes  but she also played different versions  of herself and so got to start fresh  didn't we tell you it was going to be  complete and utter chaos why didn't you  believe us what do you think doctor  strange 2 would be like if it didn't run  into all of these barriers let us know  your thoughts in the comments and thanks  for hanging out with us here at the  things

